Proximity Mac

This product includes the SFace face recognition model from OpenCV Zoo
(https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_recognition_sface),
"SFace: Sigmoid-Constrained Hypersphere Loss for Robust Face Recognition",
Yaoyao Zhong, Weihong Deng et al. Copyright the original authors.

It is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Sources/PresenceSensors/Resources/SFace.mlmodelc is a Core ML conversion of
face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx with fp16 weights, made by
scripts/convert-sface.sh. The weights are otherwise unmodified.
